            "description": [
                "SYSREQ_TURN_SIGNAL_SIGNALING (Turn Signal Indication): When the driver asserts a left or right turn intention, the system shall illuminate only the front and rear turn indicator lamps on the side matching the active turn input.",
                "",
                "Signal path the guarantee rests on:",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  drv([\"Driver_HazardLightButton<br/>Driver_TurnSignal\"]) --> sccm[\"SCCM_Lighting\"]",
                "  sccm -->|\"HazardLightButton<br/>TurnSignal\"| bcm[\"BCM_Lighting\"]",
                "  bcm -->|\"LeftTurnLightRequest\"| rlcm[\"RLCM_Lighting\"]",
                "  rlcm -->|\"ReqLeft\"| devs2[\"DEVS2_Lighting\"]",
                "  devs2 --> lamp([\"Lamp_RearLeftTurn\"])",
                "```"
            ],
